          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"A gentle, coherent story in which June's choice to listen is respected; the unresolved {child} placeholder is a visible grammar/editing flaw.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"June's self-chosen single beat creates a clear emotional turn and concrete shared ending; {child} remains an editing error.\" ,\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Respecting June's decision to listen gives the quiet ending meaning, though the {child} placeholder disrupts polish.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The ribbon and softer drum sound add sensory detail before June independently joins with one beat; {child} is an uncorrected placeholder.\" ,\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The story clearly frames listening as valid participation and closes with a fitting image of shared music, despite {child}.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"June choosing and positioning her own chair supports the theme of agency, leading to a calm but complete listening outcome; {child} is a flaw.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The preliminary pattern adds a small responsive moment, but the causal outcome remains June's respected choice to listen; {child} lowers polish.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"Chair choice and an unpressured demonstration reinforce the welcoming premise, ending concretely with stacking chairs; {child} remains unresolved.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"A coherent quiet-resolution story: June controls her distance, listens, and remains through cleanup; the {child} placeholder mars grammar.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":6,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The extra drum demonstration lightly enriches June's listening decision, but the same quiet participation plot and {child} error remain.\" ,\"group_id\":0}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":1,\"causal_path\":2,\"ending\":2,\"language\":2,\"overall\":2},\"diversity_evidence\":\"All ten stories share the same premise of Mara welcoming hesitant June into music practice with a borrowed drum. Most resolve through June choosing to listen (s000029, s000047, s000034, s000043, s000068, s000096, s000005, s000085); only s000057 and s000073 materially vary the final choice by having June offer one beat. Chair, ribbon, and preliminary-pattern additions are minor scene variations rather than distinct plots. This sample does not establish diversity across the entire generator.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"Mara offers choices without pressure; June chooses to listen rather than play, and her listening becomes the shared musical connection.\"},{\"group_id\":1,\"summary\":\"Mara offers choices without pressure; June elects to answer one drum call with a single beat, gaining ownership of a brief duet.\"}]}"
